      <div type="clause" n="Prol., 1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> Prol., 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is ærest, þæt hig gecwædon, þæt hí ænne God lufian woldon ⁊ ælcne hæþendom georne aworpen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the first place, they declared they would love one God, and zealously renounce all heathen practices.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is ærest, þæt hi gecwædon, þæt hí ænne God lufian woldan ⁊ ælcne hæþendom georne aworpen.</ab>
